<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin.css" />
  <style>
    .landing-card {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 4rem auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .landing-card h1 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--brand);
    }
    .landing-card p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .call-to-action {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .button-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--brand);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .button-primary:hover {
      background: var(--brand-hover);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="login-page">
  <div class="card landing-card">
    <h1>Aya & Hadith Bot</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to the Aya & Hadith Slack bot! This service delivers carefully selected, human-reviewed Islamic content directly to you in a daily direct message.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>How it works:</strong> We use a rotating delivery schedule. One day you will receive an inspiring Quranic Aya, and the following day you will receive a meaningful Hadith.
    </p>
    <div class="call-to-action">
      <h2>How to use it</h2>
      <p>
        To start receiving daily messages, simply send a direct message to the bot in Slack with the command:
        <br><code>/subscribe</code>
      </p>
      <a href="/api/v1/slack/install" class="button-primary">Add to Slack</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
